WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,720 --> 00:00:05,900
I’ll send you home first to live forever

2
00:00:06,140 --> 00:00:09,670
I'm back. What happened?

3
00:00:10,070 --> 00:00:12,130
Someone from the county is here

4
00:00:12,330 --> 00:00:14,530
He said that the contract procedures for your back-up contract were incomplete.

5
00:00:14,690 --> 00:00:15,930
It's illegal land occupation

6
00:00:16,170 --> 00:00:17,330
They are holding wind strips

7
00:00:17,490 --> 00:00:19,290
Even the door to your new home must be sealed.

8
00:00:19,690 --> 00:00:22,860
Seal my home

9
00:00:23,180 --> 00:00:26,600
Hongxia of the Qing Dynasty wouldn't let them in

10
00:00:27,740 --> 00:00:35,790
The gang had already drawn their guns and took my wife in the car.

11
00:00:35,950 --> 00:00:37,350
Changsheng, don’t be impulsive
